  <h1 class="page-title">Infrastructure & Network Audits</h1>
  <p class="prose-content">An independent, evidence-based assessment of your physical, network, and security infrastructure against what your business actually requires.</p>
  <a href="/contact.html" class="btn-primary">Request an Audit</a>
</section>

<section class="content-section">
  <div class="prose-content">
    <h2 class="section-title">The Problem and Our Approach</h2>
    <p>The problem: most organisations cannot answer whether their infrastructure meets the operational and regulatory standards they are held to. Documentation is stale, configurations have drifted from their original design, and nobody holds an independent view. This creates blind spots that only surface during incidents or examinations.</p>
    <p>Our approach combines on-site and remote inspection of network architecture, device configurations, physical environment, security controls, and operational processes. We benchmark findings against international standards and local regulatory requirements to give you a defensible assessment.</p>
    <p>Outcomes you receive: a findings register, risk-prioritised remediation plan, compliance gap analysis, and a validated infrastructure baseline you can build on with confidence.</p>
  </div>
</section>

